{{wikipedia|Suspense}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{AF.}} ''[[suspens]]'' as in ''[[en suspens]]'', from {{OF.}} ''[[suspens]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-suspense.ogg|Audio (US)}}

* Rhymes: [[Rhymes:English:-ɛns|-ɛns]]

===Noun===
'''suspense'''

# the condition of being [[suspend]]ed
# the [[pleasurable]] [[emotion]] of [[anticipation]] and [[excitement]] regarding the [[outcome]] or [[climax]] of a [[book]], [[film]] etc
# the [[unpleasant]] emotion of [[anxiety]] or [[apprehension]] in an [[uncertain]] situation

====Derived terms====
* [[suspenseful]]

====Related terms====
* [[cliffhanger]]
* [[tenterhook]]

